{
  "summary": "This experiment tested concat fusion with the high-performing imagenet_vit_l image encoder and transformer aggregation in a multimodal, multiprofile setting. It achieved validation accuracy of 0.7207 and F1 of 0.6815, slightly lower than the previous best (config_008: 0.725 accuracy, 0.685 F1) using weighted fusion with the same image encoder. The result suggests concat fusion may still be viable with strong image encoders, but the exact contribution of the fusion method remains uncertain due to potential interactions with other components like aggregation and encoder choices."
}

